# The section was renamed writing -> notes. /writing and any URL under it that
# was never a real post still 301 to the notes index.
#
# /writing/* also matches the two removed starter posts. Those requests do not
# use this file: an exact-path Pages Function returns 410, and Pages does not
# apply _redirects to a request a Function serves. A 301 from a deleted post to
# a listing is a soft 404, which is what Search Console was flagging. _redirects
# cannot send 410, so those four URLs are not listed here.
/writing                            /notes 301
/writing/*                          /notes 301
